# nothing from the private working repo belongs here
*.bom-bak
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Belt and braces. The privacy gate's pattern list is the set of names, addresses
# and serials that must never appear in this repo - so a copy of it HERE would
# publish exactly what it exists to keep out. It lives in the private repo only,
# and hooks/pre-commit reads it from there by absolute path. This line is so a
# stray copy cannot be swept up by `git add -A`, not because one is expected.
.privacy-patterns
